Output docs/demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 760
Set Height 260
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Type "export PS1='$ '"
Enter
Sleep 300ms

Sleep 1s

Type "truthroute --help"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type `truthroute compare "Is the 2020 US election secure?" --models openai,anthropic,gemini --dry-run`
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
